** MMP9500 - REPORT-WRITER COLUMN-SPEC CONTINUATION FIXTURE (ISSUE #24)
** 5T/30T (Natural's "tab to column n") appear on their own continuation
** lines within this WRITE statement's operand list. CONTINUATION_LEAD_COLSPEC
** must fold them into the WRITE so its interaction row carries the whole
** operand list, not just "'CERTIFICATE REPORT'". Per the same accepted
** behaviour as the 4.5/MMP9000 fixture, each folded continuation line is
** still independently visited by the main loop and (correctly) doesn't
** stand alone as its own statement -- see test_coverage_snapshot.py's note.
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
1 #HEAT-NO (A8)
1 #CAST-DATE (D)
END-DEFINE
WRITE 'CERTIFICATE REPORT'
  5T 'HEAT NO:' #HEAT-NO
  30T 'DATE:' #CAST-DATE
END
